"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-moon-icon moon-icon"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><!--]--><main id="content"><div class="hero-stage"><div class="hero-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"><i class="aurora aurora-one"></i><i class="aurora aurora-two"></i><div class="hero-grid"></div></div><section id="home" data-section class="hero shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>OSCAR BAHAMONDE · SOFTWARE ENGINEER</p><h1>Ideas ambiciosas.<br><span>Sistemas reales.</span></h1><p class="hero-intro">Diseño y construyo software, datos e inteligencia artificial. De la primera idea a la infraestructura que la hace posible.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary magnetic" href="#contact">Exploremos tu idea<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right-icon"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="#projects">Ver mi trabajo<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-icon"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><p class="hero-note">Desde Perú. Con visión global.</p></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="portrait-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="portrait-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div><figure class="hero-portrait"><picture><!--[--><!--[--><source type="image/avif" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 88vw, (max-width: 1023px) 44vw, 520px" srcset="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 1w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 2w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 338w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 520w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=768&amp;q=60 676w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;q=60 1040w"><!--]--><!--[--><source type="image/webp" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 88vw, (max-width: 1023px) 44vw, 520px" srcset="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 1w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 2w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 338w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 520w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=768&amp;q=60 676w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;q=60 1040w"><!--]--><!--[--><img width="620" height="760" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" data-nuxt-pic alt="Retrato de Oscar Bahamonde" loading="eager" src="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;q=60" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 88vw, (max-width: 1023px) 44vw, 520px" srcset="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 1w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 2w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 338w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=60 520w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=768&amp;q=60 676w, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=1280&amp;q=60 1040w"><!--]--><!--]--></picture><figcaption><span class="mono">AI · DATA · CLOUD</span><span>Ingeniería con visión de producto.</span></figcaption></figure><div class="hero-signal" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles-icon"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg><span>SOFTWARE<br><strong>WITH PURPOSE.</strong></span></div><span class="hero-coordinate mono" aria-hidden="true">LIMA, PE ↗ WORLDWIDE</span></div><a class="hero-scroll" href="#bio"><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down-icon"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>Sigue explorando</a><div class="hero-index mono" aria-hidden="true">01 — 09</div></section></div><div class="trust-strip"><div class="shell"><span>Experiencia en</span><strong>Globant</strong><strong>Dynata</strong><strong>Pronti AI</strong><strong>Huawei</strong><strong>Telefónica</strong></div></div><section id="bio" data-section class="section shell bio-section"><div data-reveal class="numbered-heading" data-number="01"><p class="eyebrow">01 / UN POCO SOBRE MÍ</p><h2>Curioso por naturaleza.<br><span>Ingeniero por vocación.</span></h2><p class="body-copy">Soy Oscar. Ingeniero de software, datos e inteligencia artificial. Me muevo entre la profundidad técnica y la visión de producto: del primer prototipo a la infraestructura que lo sostiene.</p><p class="body-copy muted">He trabajado con equipos globales en backend, datos y confiabilidad. Hoy ayudo a convertir necesidades de negocio en tecnología útil y mantenible.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://linkedin.com/in/obahamondem/">Mi trayectoria en LinkedIn<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right-icon"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="bio-aside spotlight-card" data-reveal><div class="bio-profile-row"><div class="bio-photo"><img width="128" height="128" data-nuxt-img srcset="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 1x, /_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Retrato de Oscar Bahamonde" loading="lazy" src="/_vercel/image?url=%2Fimages%2Foscar-portrait.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=85"></div><span class="bio-monogram" aria-hidden="true">ob<span>↗</span></span></div><article class="achievement"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap-icon"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg><div><h3>Primer puesto de ingreso a la PUCP</h3><p>Computación general · 2007</p></div></article><article class="achievement"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trophy-icon"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"></path><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"></path><path d="M4 22h16"></path><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"></path><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"></path><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"></path></svg><div><h3>Ganador del hackathon AWS User Group Perú</h3><p>2023 · Más de 50 equipos · Plataforma para desarrolladores potenciada por ChatGPT.</p></div></article><div class="achievement-metric" aria-hidden="true"><strong><span data-counter="50">50</span>+</strong><span>equipos · hackathon 2023</span></div><div class="speaker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mic-vocal-icon"><path d="m11 7.601-5.994 8.19a1 1 0 0 0 .1 1.298l.817.818a1 1 0 0 0 1.314.087L15.09 12"></path><path d="M16.5 21.174C15.5 20.5 14.372 20 13 20c-2.058 0-3.928 2.356-6 2-2.072-.356-2.775-3.369-1.5-4.5"></path><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="5"></circle></svg>AWS Speaker</div></div></section><section id="experience" data-section class="section section-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading numbered-heading" data-number="02" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / EXPERIENCIA</p><h2>Del código<br><span>a producción.</span></h2></div><p>Backend, plataformas de datos y confiabilidad en equipos globales.</p></div><ol class="career-timeline" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="dynata" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>01</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/dynata.png" alt="Dynata" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Dynata</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2025-01" data-v-136d0a06>ene 2025</time> — <time datetime="2026-03" data-v-136d0a06>mar 2026</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · En remoto</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Site Reliability Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Administración de más de 30 clústeres AWS EKS en producción. Autoscaling de GPU con Karpenter: mejora del 40% en utilización de recursos. Pipelines CI/CD con TeamCity, Kotlin DSL y GitLab: reducción del 75% en tiempos de despliegue. Observabilidad centralizada con OpenTelemetry: reducción del 50% en MTTR. Automatización con Terraform y Ansible: ahorro de 150 horas mensuales de operación manual.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>AWS EKS</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Kubernetes</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Karpenter</li><li data-v-136d0a06>TeamCity</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Kotlin</li><li data-v-136d0a06>GitLab</li><li data-v-136d0a06>OpenTelemetry</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Terraform</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Ansible</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="globant" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>02</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#111827;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/globant.png" alt="Globant" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Globant</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2023-09" data-v-136d0a06>sept 2023</time> — <time datetime="2024-12" data-v-136d0a06>dic 2024</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · En remoto</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Senior Data Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Plataforma de desarrollo con onboarding automatizado, Sphinx y RAG sobre PostgreSQL/pgvector: reducción del 80% en tiempo de incorporación. Automatización de pruebas de UI con Python: reducción del 60% en creación de tests. Pipelines de datos para Disney con CDK, Kinesis, S3, DynamoDB y Redshift. IA conversacional y RAG seguro con Dialogflow, Cognito y Microsoft SSO, y pipelines de entrenamiento ML con SageMaker, Glue, Lambda y Step Functions.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>PostgreSQL</li><li data-v-136d0a06>pgvector</li><li data-v-136d0a06>AWS CDK</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Kinesis</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Redshift</li><li data-v-136d0a06>SageMaker</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Dialogflow</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="plainenglish" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>03</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#111827;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/plainenglish.png" alt="In Plain English" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>In Plain English</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2023-06" data-v-136d0a06>jun 2023</time> — <time datetime="2024-11" data-v-136d0a06>nov 2024</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Remote</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Freelance Technical Writer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Publicaciones técnicas sobre Python, inteligencia artificial y JavaScript.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>AI</li><li data-v-136d0a06>JavaScript</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="pronti" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>04</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/pronti.png" alt="Pronti AI" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Pronti AI</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2023-01" data-v-136d0a06>ene 2023</time> — <time datetime="2023-03" data-v-136d0a06>mar 2023</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · En remoto</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Back End Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Migración del backend Flask a FastAPI para una plataforma de prueba virtual de ropa con IA, usando Python, PostgreSQL y Milvus. Procesamiento asíncrono con RabbitMQ y Firebase Realtime Database para generación paralela de imágenes y actualizaciones en tiempo real. Despliegue en Kubernetes sobre GCP e integración con Cloud Functions. Optimización conjunta con ingenieros de IA de embeddings, generación de imágenes y pipelines de datos.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>FastAPI</li><li data-v-136d0a06>PostgreSQL</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Milvus</li><li data-v-136d0a06>RabbitMQ</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Firebase</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Kubernetes</li><li data-v-136d0a06>GCP</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="freelance" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>05</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-monogram" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>A</div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Autónomo</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2022-07" data-v-136d0a06>jul 2022</time> — <time datetime="2023-01" data-v-136d0a06>ene 2023</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Global</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Freelance Consultant</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Parte de mi trayectoria profesional. Más detalles en LinkedIn.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Django</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Cybersecurity</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="bluetab" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>06</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/bluetab.png" alt="Bluetab América, an IBM Company" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Bluetab América, an IBM Company</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2022-02" data-v-136d0a06>feb 2022</time> — <time datetime="2022-07" data-v-136d0a06>jul 2022</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Lima, Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Data Developer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Pipelines PySpark para reportes regulatorios del sector financiero. Procesamiento de datos bancarios bajo requisitos de seguridad relacionados con PCI. Modernización y migración de infraestructura a AWS; transformación, validación y reporting distribuido.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>PySpark</li><li data-v-136d0a06>SQL</li><li data-v-136d0a06>AWS</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="indra" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>07</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/indra.png" alt="Indra" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Indra</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2021-04" data-v-136d0a06>abr 2021</time> — <time datetime="2021-12" data-v-136d0a06>dic 2021</time><!----></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Big Data Developer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Automatización de pipelines para banca y seguros con Python, PySpark, Hadoop y SQL. Soluciones analíticas y data marts con Redshift, Athena y S3. Componentes reutilizables para mejorar la integración y el procesamiento de datos.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>PySpark</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Hadoop</li><li data-v-136d0a06>SQL</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Redshift</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Athena</li><li data-v-136d0a06>S3</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="rayke" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>08</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-monogram" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>R</div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Rayke</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2021-03" data-v-136d0a06>mar 2021</time> — <time datetime="2021-07" data-v-136d0a06>jul 2021</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Lima, Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>DevOps Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Desarrollo backend con Node.js/Express y Python/Flask. Frontend con Vue.js e implementación de GitOps sobre AWS con Amplify y Serverless Framework.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Node.js</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Express</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Python</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Flask</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Vue.js</li><li data-v-136d0a06>AWS Amplify</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="data-analytics" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>09</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/data-analytics.png" alt="DATA &amp; ANALYTICS" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(.65) contrast(3);" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>DATA &amp; ANALYTICS</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2021-01" data-v-136d0a06>ene 2021</time> — <time datetime="2021-03" data-v-136d0a06>mar 2021</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Cloud Architect</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Arquitectura de soluciones AWS, desarrollo de alianzas y asesoría técnica para clientes.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>AWS</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="valtx" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>10</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#111827;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/valtx.png" alt="Valtx Perú" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="filter:contrast(1.25);" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Valtx Perú</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2020-02" data-v-136d0a06>feb 2020</time> — <time datetime="2020-12" data-v-136d0a06>dic 2020</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>IT Analyst</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Diseño y desarrollo de soluciones TIC, gestión de licitaciones y soluciones integradas, Agile Inception y mejora de procesos.</p><!----></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="telefonica" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>11</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="light" style="background:#111827;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/telefonica.png" alt="Telefónica" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Telefónica</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2017-08" data-v-136d0a06>ago 2017</time> — <time datetime="2019-11" data-v-136d0a06>nov 2019</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Presales Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Diseño integral de telecomunicaciones y redes empresariales para clientes corporativos y de gobierno. Dimensionamiento y arquitectura con Cisco, Fortinet y AudioCodes. Propuestas técnicas y comerciales para proyectos y licitaciones, coordinando ingeniería y equipos comerciales.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Cisco</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Fortinet</li><li data-v-136d0a06>AudioCodes</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="cotener" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>12</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/cotener.png" alt="COTENER" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>COTENER</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2017-06" data-v-136d0a06>jun 2017</time> — <time datetime="2017-08" data-v-136d0a06>ago 2017</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · San Isidro, Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Account Manager</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Gestión de relaciones B2B y desarrollo de negocios en telecomunicaciones. Ventas técnicas del portafolio JDSU/VIAVI; coordinación de requerimientos, demostraciones y propuestas comerciales.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>JDSU</li><li data-v-136d0a06>VIAVI</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="huawei" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>13</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/huawei.png" alt="Huawei Technologies" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Huawei Technologies</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2014-02" data-v-136d0a06>feb 2014</time> — <time datetime="2016-11" data-v-136d0a06>nov 2016</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Service Sales Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Propuestas de servicios técnicos y licitaciones para infraestructura de telecomunicaciones. Pruebas de concepto y validación técnica con ingeniería. Respuestas a RFP/RFQ de proyectos llave en mano y servicios gestionados, con soluciones de redes inalámbricas, core y modernización.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Telecommunications</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Wireless</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Core networks</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="netcor" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>14</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/netcor.png" alt="NETCORPERU" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="filter:brightness(.55) contrast(4);" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>NETCORPERU</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2013-07" data-v-136d0a06>jul 2013</time> — <time datetime="2014-02" data-v-136d0a06>feb 2014</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Provincia de Lima, Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Network Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Gestión del despliegue WiMAX Airspan para Telefónica. Diseño y despliegue de fibra óptica empresarial para BCP. Casos de uso y operación de la plataforma Oracle PCRF de Claro.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>Airspan WiMAX</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Fiber optics</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Oracle PCRF</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="osc" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>15</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="color" style="background:#ffffff;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/osc.png" alt="OSC Telecoms &amp; Security Solutions" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>OSC Telecoms &amp; Security Solutions</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2013-01" data-v-136d0a06>ene 2013</time> — <time datetime="2013-07" data-v-136d0a06>jul 2013</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Provincia de Lima, Perú</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>NOC Engineer</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Monitoreo de infraestructura móvil y servicios de valor agregado en el entorno 3G de Nextel. Soporte de incidentes de primer nivel, clasificación, diagnóstico y escalamiento. Coordinación de técnicos de campo y drive testing; operación preventiva y reactiva de redes.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>3G</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Network operations</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><li class="career-stop" data-company-id="telefonica-trainee" data-reveal data-v-136d0a06><span class="career-node" aria-hidden="true" data-v-136d0a06>16</span><article class="career-card" data-v-136d0a06><div class="career-brand" data-v-136d0a06><div class="company-logo-chip" data-logo-tone="light" style="background:#111827;" data-v-136d0a06><img src="/logos/telefonica-trainee.png" alt="Telefónica" width="160" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="" data-v-136d0a06></div><strong data-v-136d0a06>Telefónica</strong></div><div class="career-content" data-v-136d0a06><p class="career-date" data-v-136d0a06><time datetime="2011-02" data-v-136d0a06>feb 2011</time> — <time datetime="2011-12" data-v-136d0a06>dic 2011</time><span data-v-136d0a06> · Lima, Perú · Presencial</span></p><h3 data-v-136d0a06>Telecommunications Engineering Trainee</h3><p class="career-description" data-v-136d0a06>Mantenimiento de aplicaciones internas de analítica y reporting con LAMP. Integración de hojas de cálculo con MySQL. Soporte a KPIs operativos, dashboards y procesamiento de datos.</p><ul class="career-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-136d0a06><!--[--><li data-v-136d0a06>LAMP</li><li data-v-136d0a06>MySQL</li><li data-v-136d0a06>Excel</li><!--]--></ul></div></article></li><!--]--></ol><a class="text-link" href="https://linkedin.com/in/obahamondem/">Más trayectoria en LinkedIn<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right-icon"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id="skills" data-section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading numbered-heading" data-number="03" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / MI CAJA DE HERRAMIENTAS</p><h2>La herramienta correcta.<br><span>Para el problema correcto.</span></h2></div><p>Tecnologías que conectan producto, datos e infraestructura.</p></div><div class="skill-categories" data-v-39057c18><!--[--><section class="skill-category" data-reveal data-v-39057c18><h3 data-v-39057c18>Lenguajes y backend</h3><ul data-v-39057c18><!--[--><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/python.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Python</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/typescript.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>TypeScript</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/javascript.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>JavaScript</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img