pan><span data-v-39057c18>Firebase</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/ai.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Agentic AI &amp; RAG</span></li><!--]--></ul></section><section class="skill-category" data-reveal data-v-39057c18><h3 data-v-39057c18>Cloud e infraestructura</h3><ul data-v-39057c18><!--[--><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/amazonwebservices.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>AWS</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/googlecloud.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Google Cloud</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/docker.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Docker</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/kubernetes.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Kubernetes</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/terraform.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Terraform</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/ansible.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>Ansible</span></li><!--]--></ul></section><section class="skill-category" data-reveal data-v-39057c18><h3 data-v-39057c18>Observabilidad y mensajería</h3><ul data-v-39057c18><!--[--><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/opentelemetry.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>OpenTelemetry</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/rabbitmq.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>RabbitMQ</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/gitlab.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>GitLab</span></li><li class="skill-badge" data-v-39057c18><span class="skill-icon" data-v-39057c18><img src="/icons/teamcity.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy" data-v-39057c18></span><span data-v-39057c18>TeamCity</span></li><!--]--></ul></section><!--]--></div></section><section id="projects" data-section class="section section-projects"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading numbered-heading" data-number="04" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / TRABAJO SELECCIONADO</p><h2>Pensados para servir.<br><span>Construidos para crecer.</span></h2></div><span class="section-kicker mono">IDEA → SYSTEM → IMPACT</span></div><div class="project-showcase" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!--[--><article class="showcase-card" data-reveal data-v-2bb6eaa0><a class="project-preview" href="https://voz.oscarbahamonde.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="VOZ: abrir proyecto" data-v-2bb6eaa0><img src="/images/projects/voz.webp" alt="Captura real de VOZ en la web" width="1100" height="680" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-2bb6eaa0><span class="project-preview-kind" data-v-2bb6eaa0>Sitio del proyecto</span></a><div class="project-details" data-v-2bb6eaa0><p class="project-index" data-v-2bb6eaa0>01 / Atención conversacional para empresas.</p><h3 data-v-2bb6eaa0>VOZ</h3><p data-v-2bb6eaa0>Agentes de voz para conectar negocios y personas. Plataforma en desarrollo.</p><ul class="project-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!--[--><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Voice AI</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Enterprise integrations</li><!--]--></ul><div class="project-links" data-v-2bb6eaa0><a href="https://voz.oscarbahamonde.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-2bb6eaa0>Explorar proyecto ↗</a><!----></div></div></article><article class="showcase-card" data-reveal data-v-2bb6eaa0><a class="project-preview" href="https://github.com/bahamondeX/quipubase" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Quipubase: abrir proyecto" data-v-2bb6eaa0><img src="/images/projects/quipubase.webp" alt="Captura real de Quipubase en GitHub" width="1100" height="680" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-2bb6eaa0><span class="project-preview-kind" data-v-2bb6eaa0>Repositorio real · GitHub</span></a><div class="project-details" data-v-2bb6eaa0><p class="project-index" data-v-2bb6eaa0>02 / Explora datos estructurados y semánticos desde una API.</p><h3 data-v-2bb6eaa0>Quipubase</h3><p data-v-2bb6eaa0>Almacenamiento semántico con esquemas, búsqueda vectorial y suscripciones a datos.</p><ul class="project-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!--[--><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>RocksDB</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>JSON Schema</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Vector search</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Pub/sub</li><!--]--></ul><div class="project-links" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!----><a href="https://github.com/bahamondeX/quipubase" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-2bb6eaa0>GitHub ↗<!----></a></div></div></article><article class="showcase-card" data-reveal data-v-2bb6eaa0><a class="project-preview" href="https://github.com/obahamonde/aiofauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="aiofauna: abrir proyecto" data-v-2bb6eaa0><img src="/images/projects/aiofauna.webp" alt="Captura real de aiofauna en GitHub" width="1100" height="680" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-2bb6eaa0><span class="project-preview-kind" data-v-2bb6eaa0>Repositorio real · GitHub</span></a><div class="project-details" data-v-2bb6eaa0><p class="project-index" data-v-2bb6eaa0>03 / Integra modelos tipados, HTTP y datos.</p><h3 data-v-2bb6eaa0>aiofauna</h3><p data-v-2bb6eaa0>Framework backend asíncrono para aplicaciones Python y arquitectura serverless.</p><ul class="project-stack" aria-label="Tecnologías" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!--[--><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Python</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Aiohttp</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>Pydantic</li><li data-v-2bb6eaa0>FaunaDB</li><!--]--></ul><div class="project-links" data-v-2bb6eaa0><!----><a href="https://github.com/obahamonde/aiofauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-2bb6eaa0>GitHub ↗<span class="project-stars" title="Estrellas observadas en la auditoría" data-v-2bb6eaa0> · 8 ★</span></a></div></div></article><!--]--></div></div></section><section id="services" data-section class="section section-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading numbered-heading" data-number="05" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / CONSTRUYAMOS ALGO</p><h2>De tu próximo paso<br><span>a tu próximo producto.</span></h2></div><p>Alcances claros. Entregables concretos. Precios en soles peruanos.</p></div><!--[--><div class="service-group"><h3 class="group-title">Desarrollo web</h3><div class="service-grid"><!--[--><article class="service-card spotlight-card" data-reveal><h4>Landing con propósito</h4><p>Hasta 5 secciones con contenido proporcionado, diseño responsive y formulario conectado a correo.</p><p class="delivery"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-icon"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Sitio publicado, SEO inicial y código fuente.</p><div class="service-price"><small>Desde</small>S/500</div><button type="button" class="service-cta">Conversar sobre este servicio<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right-icon"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></article><article class="service-card spotlight-card" data-reveal><h4>Contenido bajo tu control</h4><p>Sitio con panel de administración, un rol editorial e integración de Calendar y correo.</p><p class="delivery"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-icon"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>CMS configurado, integración y guía de uso.</p><div class="service-price"><small>Desde</small>S/1,500</div><button type="button" class="service-cta">Conversar sobre este servicio<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right-icon"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></article><article class="service-card spotlight-card" data-reveal><h4>E-commerce conectado</h4><p>MVP de catálogo físico o digital, base de datos, API, autenticación, un checkout y CRM básico.</p><p class="delivery"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-icon"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Flujo de compra, panel básico e integración de pagos.</p><div class="service-price"><small>Desde</small>S/3,500</div><button type="button" class="service-cta">Conversar sobre este servicio<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-l